{
  "version": 1,
  "courseId": 1362070,
  "sourceLanguage": "en",
  "targetLanguage": "zh-TW",
  "lectures": [
    {
      "id": "39659790",
      "title": "User Input & Two-Way-Binding",
      "sourceHash": "08544931dda919a255a82afdde9924de0a76285ed56faa55d9452d0a428b0662",
      "cues": [
        {
          "id": 1,
          "start": 0.78,
          "end": 1.77,
          "en": "So now that we're able",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 2,
          "start": 1.77,
          "end": 4.35,
          "en": "to start editing and stop editing,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 3,
          "start": 4.35,
          "end": 7.29,
          "en": "and that we got this player name inserted here,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 4,
          "start": 7.29,
          "end": 10.68,
          "en": "it would now be nice if we could also edit this player name.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 5,
          "start": 10.68,
          "end": 13.05,
          "en": "Because at the moment, if you try to edit it,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 6,
          "start": 13.05,
          "end": 16.53,
          "en": "you'll see that it actually does not work.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 7,
          "start": 16.53,
          "end": 17.91,
          "en": "And it does not work",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 8,
          "start": 17.91,
          "end": 20.97,
          "en": "because we are setting that value prop",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 9,
          "start": 20.97,
          "end": 22.32,
          "en": "on the input element.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 10,
          "start": 22.32,
          "end": 24.99,
          "en": "And the special thing about that value prop",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 11,
          "start": 24.99,
          "end": 29.04,
          "en": "is that it sets the value that's shown in the input.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 12,
          "start": 29.04,
          "end": 31.47,
          "en": "And if we try to edit this value,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 13,
          "start": 31.47,
          "end": 33.03,
          "en": "we can't do that,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 14,
          "start": 33.03,
          "end": 35.22,
          "en": "because this value which is set here,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 15,
          "start": 35.22,
          "end": 39.42,
          "en": "basically overwrites any changes we're trying to do.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 16,
          "start": 39.42,
          "end": 41.4,
          "en": "Now, one way around this problem",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 17,
          "start": 41.4,
          "end": 45.57,
          "en": "would be to set the special default value prop,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 18,
          "start": 45.57,
          "end": 48.12,
          "en": "which just sets an initial value",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 19,
          "start": 48.12,
          "end": 50.853,
          "en": "instead of enforcing a value thereafter.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 20,
          "start": 51.93,
          "end": 53.07,
          "en": "With that set,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 21,
          "start": 53.07,
          "end": 54.78,
          "en": "you'll see that if I reload,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 22,
          "start": 54.78,
          "end": 56.22,
          "en": "I still got that name here,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 23,
          "start": 56.22,
          "end": 57.753,
          "en": "but now I can edit it.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 24,
          "start": 59.01,
          "end": 59.88,
          "en": "So that's better,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 25,
          "start": 59.88,
          "end": 61.47,
          "en": "but of course when I click Save,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 26,
          "start": 61.47,
          "end": 63.84,
          "en": "it's not actually being saved.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 27,
          "start": 63.84,
          "end": 65.973,
          "en": "Instead, we switch back to Player 1.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 28,
          "start": 67.02,
          "end": 72.02,
          "en": "And therefore, I'll actually go back to just value here,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 29,
          "start": 72.06,
          "end": 75.21000000000001,
          "en": "because I wanna use a different approach anyways.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 30,
          "start": 75.21000000000001,
          "end": 78.24,
          "en": "Because we don't just wanna set the value here,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 31,
          "start": 78.24,
          "end": 81.15,
          "en": "instead, we also wanna get the changes",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 32,
          "start": 81.15,
          "end": 84.69,
          "en": "the user tries to apply to that value",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 33,
          "start": 84.69,
          "end": 88.17,
          "en": "so that we can save this updated player name",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 34,
          "start": 88.17,
          "end": 89.97,
          "en": "somewhere in this component,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 35,
          "start": 89.97,
          "end": 93.21000000000001,
          "en": "so that we can output the updated player name here",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 36,
          "start": 93.21000000000001,
          "end": 94.89,
          "en": "whenever it changes.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 37,
          "start": 94.89,
          "end": 99.78,
          "en": "So essentially, we'll need a second piece of state here,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 38,
          "start": 99.78,
          "end": 103.44,
          "en": "and that is absolutely something you can do in React.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 39,
          "start": 103.44,
          "end": 107.91,
          "en": "You can use useState more than once in the same component",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 40,
          "start": 107.91,
          "end": 111.12299999999999,
          "en": "if you got different pieces of state you want to manage.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 41,
          "start": 112.2,
          "end": 113.97,
          "en": "So here, in this case for example,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 42,
          "start": 113.97,
          "end": 117.93,
          "en": "the initial value for this state could be this name,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 43,
          "start": 117.93,
          "end": 120.39,
          "en": "which we're getting through the name prop,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 44,
          "start": 120.39,
          "end": 123.48,
          "en": "though we might wanna rename it to initialName.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 45,
          "start": 123.48,
          "end": 126.42,
          "en": "And we can use this initialName prop here",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 46,
          "start": 126.42,
          "end": 129.543,
          "en": "as an initial value for this state.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 47,
          "start": 131.25,
          "end": 133.26,
          "en": "And then again, we can use the structuring",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 48,
          "start": 133.26,
          "end": 137.673,
          "en": "to get our playerName and a setPlayerName function.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 49,
          "start": 138.54,
          "end": 139.373,
          "en": "As always,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 50,
          "start": 139.373,
          "end": 142.14,
          "en": "these constant names here are up to you,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 51,
          "start": 142.14,
          "end": 143.43,
          "en": "but they should, of course,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 52,
          "start": 143.43,
          "end": 146.163,
          "en": "describe what this state is all about.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 53,
          "start": 147.72,
          "end": 151.68,
          "en": "Now, with that, we wanna use this player name state here",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 54,
          "start": 151.68,
          "end": 154.38,
          "en": "as a dynamic value here,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 55,
          "start": 154.38,
          "end": 157.083,
          "en": "and also here for this value.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 56,
          "start": 158.91,
          "end": 161.04,
          "en": "And since I now have a name clash",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 57,
          "start": 161.04,
          "end": 164.13,
          "en": "between this constant and this variable here,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 58,
          "start": 164.13,
          "end": 166.38,
          "en": "I'll simply rename this variable here",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 59,
          "start": 166.38,
          "end": 170.04,
          "en": "to editablePlayerName, for example,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 60,
          "start": 170.04,
          "end": 172.23,
          "en": "or something like this.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 61,
          "start": 172.23,
          "end": 174.57,
          "en": "And extend this editable player name,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 62,
          "start": 174.57,
          "end": 176.793,
          "en": "that's all the output down there.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 63,
          "start": 178.53,
          "end": 181.74,
          "en": "So now with that, we got this playerName state,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 64,
          "start": 181.74,
          "end": 183.63,
          "en": "and we got this initialName prop,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 65,
          "start": 183.63,
          "end": 185.88,
          "en": "and therefore in the app component,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 66,
          "start": 185.88,
          "end": 188.73,
          "en": "we of course now should change the prop name here as well",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 67,
          "start": 188.73,
          "end": 193.73,
          "en": "to initialName for both instances of this player component.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 68,
          "start": 195.75,
          "end": 197.61,
          "en": "And in the player component,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 69,
          "start": 197.61,
          "end": 200.94,
          "en": "we now of course also wanna update this state.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 70,
          "start": 200.94,
          "end": 202.95,
          "en": "And I wanna update this state",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 71,
          "start": 202.95,
          "end": 205.293,
          "en": "whenever we type into this input field.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 72,
          "start": 206.49,
          "end": 208.53,
          "en": "Now, for this, we'll again need a function",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 73,
          "start": 208.53,
          "end": 211.5,
          "en": "that should be triggered upon some event.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 74,
          "start": 211.5,
          "end": 214.26,
          "en": "And I'll name this function handleChange",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 75,
          "start": 214.26,
          "end": 216.9,
          "en": "because it's actually the change event",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 76,
          "start": 216.9,
          "end": 218.57999999999998,
          "en": "to which I wanna listen.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 77,
          "start": 218.57999999999998,
          "end": 219.99,
          "en": "This is an official event",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 78,
          "start": 219.99,
          "end": 222.51,
          "en": "which is emitted by this input field here,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 79,
          "start": 222.51,
          "end": 223.59,
          "en": "which will, in the end,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 80,
          "start": 223.59,
          "end": 227.4,
          "en": "be triggered whenever the user enters a character",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 81,
          "start": 227.4,
          "end": 228.81,
          "en": "into this input field,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 82,
          "start": 228.81,
          "end": 232.02,
          "en": "or pastes a value into this input field,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 83,
          "start": 232.02,
          "end": 234.03,
          "en": "or anything like that.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 84,
          "start": 234.03,
          "end": 235.62,
          "en": "And we can listen to this event",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 85,
          "start": 235.62,
          "end": 240.03,
          "en": "by setting the onChange prop here on this input field.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 86,
          "start": 240.03,
          "end": 241.41,
          "en": "And the value for this prop",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 87,
          "start": 241.41,
          "end": 243.9,
          "en": "is now the handleChange function.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 88,
          "start": 243.9,
          "end": 246.303,
          "en": "So this new function here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 89,
          "start": 248.64,
          "end": 251.01,
          "en": "Now, in this handleChange function,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 90,
          "start": 251.01,
          "end": 256.01,
          "en": "we then wanna call setPlayerName to set that state,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 91,
          "start": 256.71,
          "end": 259.56,
          "en": "to that new name that was entered by the user.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 92,
          "start": 259.56,
          "end": 261.12,
          "en": "And now we just need to find out",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 93,
          "start": 261.12,
          "end": 264.27,
          "en": "which value was entered by the user.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 94,
          "start": 264.27,
          "end": 266.4,
          "en": "And here, it's really important to understand",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 95,
          "start": 266.4,
          "end": 270,
          "en": "that onChange will trigger for every keystroke,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 96,
          "start": 270,
          "end": 273.03,
          "en": "and it will provide us with an event object",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 97,
          "start": 273.03,
          "end": 276.27,
          "en": "that contains the value that was entered by the user.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 98,
          "start": 276.27,
          "end": 278.13,
          "en": "So for example, the value of the key",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 99,
          "start": 278.13,
          "end": 280.26,
          "en": "that was hit by the user.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 100,
          "start": 280.26,
          "end": 284.01,
          "en": "So here we can accept this event object",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 101,
          "start": 284.01,
          "end": 285.6,
          "en": "as an event parameter.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 102,
          "start": 285.6,
          "end": 286.83,
          "en": "This name is up to you.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 103,
          "start": 286.83,
          "end": 289.77,
          "en": "But it will be an object describing the event",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 104,
          "start": 289.77,
          "end": 291.6,
          "en": "that was emitted.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 105,
          "start": 291.6,
          "end": 294.69,
          "en": "And we'll get this value here automatically",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 106,
          "start": 294.69,
          "end": 297.12,
          "en": "because we're passing a pointer",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 107,
          "start": 297.12,
          "end": 299.52,
          "en": "at the handleChange function",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 108,
          "start": 299.52,
          "end": 303.15,
          "en": "to the onChange prop on this input element.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 109,
          "start": 303.15,
          "end": 306.81,
          "en": "And React will therefore call the handleChange function",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 110,
          "start": 306.81,
          "end": 309.21,
          "en": "when that change event occurs.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 111,
          "start": 309.21,
          "end": 312.33,
          "en": "And React will give us such an event object",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 112,
          "start": 312.33,
          "end": 314.49,
          "en": "as an argument for this function",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 113,
          "start": 314.49,
          "end": 316.77,
          "en": "when it calls this function.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 114,
          "start": 316.77,
          "end": 319.32,
          "en": "So we'll get this here automatically.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 115,
          "start": 319.32,
          "end": 322.89,
          "en": "And this event object, of course, can be locked",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 116,
          "start": 322.89,
          "end": 325.32,
          "en": "so that we can take a look at it.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 117,
          "start": 325.32,
          "end": 328.89,
          "en": "But it will have a target property,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 118,
          "start": 328.89,
          "end": 332.90999999999997,
          "en": "which will refer to the element that did emit the event.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 119,
          "start": 332.90999999999997,
          "end": 335.90999999999997,
          "en": "So to this input element here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 120,
          "start": 335.90999999999997,
          "end": 337.77,
          "en": "And this input element,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 121,
          "start": 337.77,
          "end": 340.32,
          "en": "turns out to have a value property,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 122,
          "start": 340.32,
          "end": 344.22,
          "en": "which will hold the value the user tried to enter",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 123,
          "start": 344.22,
          "end": 346.14,
          "en": "before it's then again overwritten",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 124,
          "start": 346.14,
          "end": 349.08299999999997,
          "en": "by the value set through that value prop.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 125,
          "start": 350.64,
          "end": 351.78,
          "en": "So that's how we get access",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 126,
          "start": 351.78,
          "end": 354.69,
          "en": "to the value the user wanted to enter.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 127,
          "start": 354.69,
          "end": 356.25,
          "en": "And we're now setting this value",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 128,
          "start": 356.25,
          "end": 359.13,
          "en": "as a new state for player name.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 129,
          "start": 359.13,
          "end": 361.95,
          "en": "And since we're then feeding player name",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 130,
          "start": 361.95,
          "end": 365.07,
          "en": "back into the value prop of the input element,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 131,
          "start": 365.07,
          "end": 369.21,
          "en": "that entered value will now also be reflected",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 132,
          "start": 369.21,
          "end": 370.8,
          "en": "in this input element.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 133,
          "start": 370.8,
          "end": 374.16,
          "en": "Because we're now updating that value that's displayed",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 134,
          "start": 374.16,
          "end": 376.83299999999997,
          "en": "based on the value the user wanted to have.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 135,
          "start": 378.42,
          "end": 380.37,
          "en": "So with all of that,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 136,
          "start": 380.37,
          "end": 381.87,
          "en": "I'll get rid of the console lock",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 137,
          "start": 381.87,
          "end": 384.9,
          "en": "because I don't really wanna look into this event object,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 138,
          "start": 384.9,
          "end": 386.88,
          "en": "but you can of course do that.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 139,
          "start": 386.88,
          "end": 390.81,
          "en": "But with all of that, if we save all files and reload,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 140,
          "start": 390.81,
          "end": 393.99,
          "en": "you'll see that we still get this initial value.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 141,
          "start": 393.99,
          "end": 396.57,
          "en": "But if I now replace this with MAX,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 142,
          "start": 396.57,
          "end": 400.74,
          "en": "this works, and that's the first new thing.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 143,
          "start": 400.74,
          "end": 402.81,
          "en": "And in addition, if I click Save,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 144,
          "start": 402.81,
          "end": 404.82,
          "en": "this is also saved,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 145,
          "start": 404.82,
          "end": 408.87,
          "en": "because we're now managing this player name as a state.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 146,
          "start": 408.87,
          "end": 410.43,
          "en": "And of course this works",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 147,
          "start": 410.43,
          "end": 414.03,
          "en": "for both instances of this player component.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 148,
          "start": 414.03,
          "end": 417.45,
          "en": "And this is therefore an important new concept.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 149,
          "start": 417.45,
          "end": 420.48,
          "en": "This is how you can get access to values",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 150,
          "start": 420.48,
          "end": 424.65,
          "en": "entered by a user into an input field with help of onChange,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 151,
          "start": 424.65,
          "end": 427.53,
          "en": "and managing a separate piece of state,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 152,
          "start": 427.53,
          "end": 430.29,
          "en": "and how you can make sure that this updated value",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 153,
          "start": 430.29,
          "end": 433.17,
          "en": "is then reflected back into this input field",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 154,
          "start": 433.17,
          "end": 436.86,
          "en": "and also in other parts of the application if needed.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 155,
          "start": 436.86,
          "end": 440.7,
          "en": "By the way, this way of listening to a change on the input",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 156,
          "start": 440.7,
          "end": 444.36,
          "en": "and then feeding that updated value back into this input",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 157,
          "start": 444.36,
          "end": 447.06,
          "en": "is also called two-way binding,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 158,
          "start": 447.06,
          "end": 450.45,
          "en": "because we're getting a value out of this input",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 159,
          "start": 450.45,
          "end": 453.93,
          "en": "and we're feeding a value back into this input.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 160,
          "start": 453.93,
          "end": 455.46,
          "en": "But that's just a side note.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 161,
          "start": 455.46,
          "end": 458.73,
          "en": "If you hear people talk about two-way binding,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 162,
          "start": 458.73,
          "end": 460.203,
          "en": "that's what they mean.",
          "zh": ""
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
